    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1400-a1">

                <pb facs="1747" n="1547" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg1547"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                </opener>
                <p>[Here is set forth, with minor variations, the text of <ref target="#d1383"
                        >document No. 1383</ref>, section VII (VI).]</p>
                <p>It is the earnest wish of the three Governments that the Provisional Government
                    of the French Republic will be able to associate itself with the above
                    statement.</p>
                <p>The three Governments would be grateful if the French Provisional Government
                    would treat the present communication as strictly secret until such time as an
                    official statement is issued by the Conference.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-08-01">August 1,
                    1945</date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
